AI Statement
Artificial intelligence tools were used throughout this project to assist with coding, statistical interpretation, workflow organization, and scientific writing. AI assistance was primarily used to troubleshoot R code, refine data visualization techniques, and improve the clarity and grammar of written sections of the manuscript.
All data processing, analytical decisions, interpretation of results, and final written content were reviewed, modified, and approved by the author. AI tools were used as an aid to improve efficiency and understanding rather than to generate the project independently.
